{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/GIF1_Main.gif?t=1751359664\" /></div><strong>Hell-fungus spreads, polluting the land.\u00a0</strong>The Pebble King leads a brave knight clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five Pebbles rise as chaos nears.\u00a0Night falls fast. Forget your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>When darkness comes, the battle begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/Image1_TeamUpAndPowerUp.png?t=1751359664\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/GIF2_TeamUpAndPowerUp.gif?t=1751359664\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm better gear. Master wild skills.\u00a0Dig up ores, upgrade your Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight together, flip the fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Better hurry, night falls faster than you think!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/Image2_STAYALIVE!!!.png?t=1751359664\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087930/extras/GIF3_STAY_ALIVE!!!.gif?t=1751359664\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mold monsters are filthy strong.\u00a0Boss molds? Disgustingly brutal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stand together or get crushed into pebble dust!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Kingdom\u2019s fate is in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class